{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.52](I want some Juice)\n[00:03.38]Good ol'\n[00:03.72](DJ Victoriouz with me in the building)\n[00:09.46]Good old, good old\n[Refrain]\n[00:12.60]Good days, good days, old good days\n[00:17.66]Miss the good days, uh-huh, good days\n[00:20.94]Miss the good days, all the good days, all the good days\n[00:25.82]Good days, miss the good days\n[00:27.36]Uh, good days, miss the good days\n[00:28.98]Uh, good days, miss the good days\n[00:34.46]Goddamn, I miss the good days\n[Verse 1]\n[00:38.12]Yay, yeah, I miss the good days\n[00:40.62]In my retro J's, uh, ballin' like fadeaway, uh\n[00:43.80]Everyday makin' a play, those were the good days\n[00:47.02]Now I'm in LA in a lil' Perc, that's where I stay, uh-huh, uh\n[00:50.68]Did I say lil' Perc? I meant lil' park, I'm sorry, I was too high there\n[00:53.86]I had to cut down on the drugs\n[00:55.46]I got so high that I was scared\n[00:57.00]It's funny how all my good days lead the bad days, lead to sad days (Uh)\n[01:00.38]Pill bottle next to the ashtray, uh\n[01:01.92]Addicted to that like cocaine, uh\n[01:03.64]Boy, I got crack like the old days\n[01:05.06]Four plays then split it up four ways, uh\n[01:06.90]Whip it up, fresh like O.J\n[01:08.06]In your doorway, tryna hear what your ho say, uh\n[01:10.16]I'm with the gunplay, gun a big thot, fuck a nigga like a whore\n[01:13.16]Soon, I’ma be on all Forbes\n[01:14.80]Havin' good days on them boys\n[Refrain]\n[01:16.24]Miss the good days\n[01:21.90]Good days, miss the good days\n[01:26.28]Good days, miss the good days\n[01:27.56]Where are the good days?\n[01:28.78]Where are the good days?\n[01:31.74]Miss the good days, g-good days\n[01:35.54]Good days, 'for the codeine\n[01:37.54]Before the codeine, before the codeine\n[01:41.46](Uh, uh, uh)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:41.74]I miss the good days, before the codeine\n[01:44.88]Before the girls on the coke that’s catchin' nosebleeds\n[01:48.12]Before the Xans in my pop, when I was sippin' up in school\n[01:51.38]Before them hoes on my line that's tryna fuck me and my crew\n[01:54.72]Miss the good days, yeah, the hood days\n[01:57.80]Like, “Where you from?”\n[01:58.80]I’m talking “wish a nigga would” days\n[02:01.20]But I still wish a fuck nigga would, ayy\n[02:04.40]Choppa' on me, clip lookin' like some wood, ayy\n[02:07.70]Totin' big AK's, put a hole in yo' brain\n[02:10.84]I don’t write shit down at all, baby, this is off of the brain\n[02:14.24]If you ain't tryna fuck with me, then fuck it, off with ya' brain, ay\n[02:17.84]Disrespectful as fuck, fuck it, off with his chain\n[02:21.10]Good old days, snatchin' them chains\n[02:24.36]Listening to Prince, smoking that purple rain\n[02:27.44]I ain't throwing hands, I ain't throwing shade, ay\n[02:30.60]I'm just throwing bands, won't you come my way\n[02:33.64]Fetty (Haha)\n[Outro]\n[02:36.22]Miss the good days, miss the good days (Oh)\n[02:40.98]Miss the good days, miss the good days\n[02:43.80]Good ol' days, mmh-mmh-mm","words":[[0.52,0.52,"(I"],[0.64,1.16,"want"],[1.2,1.48,"some"],[2.94,3.34,"Juice)"],[3.38,3.48,"Good"],[3.52,3.56,"ol'"],[3.72,3.78,"(DJ"],[3.82,6.58,"Victoriouz"],[8.12,8.28,"with"],[8.42,8.46,"me"],[8.5,8.52,"in"],[8.66,8.76,"the"],[8.82,9.24,"building)"],[9.46,9.64,"Good"],[9.72,9.78,"old,"],[9.82,10.24,"good"],[12.2,12.54,"old"],[12.6,12.96,"Good"],[14.18,14.62,"days,"],[15.4,15.78,"good"],[15.82,16.8,"days,"],[16.84,16.96,"old"],[17.02,17.42,"good"],[17.46,17.62,"days"],[17.66,17.86,"Miss"],[18.48,18.54,"the"],[18.64,18.84,"good"],[19.04,19.44,"days,"],[19.48,20.04,"uh-huh,"],[20.28,20.68,"good"],[20.72,20.9,"days"],[20.94,21.12,"Miss"],[21.4,21.56,"the"],[21.88,22.1,"good"],[22.28,22.72,"days,"],[23.18,23.3,"all"],[23.36,23.4,"the"],[23.5,23.88,"good"],[23.92,24.46,"days,"],[24.98,25.08,"all"],[25.16,25.22,"the"],[25.34,25.52,"good"],[25.58,25.78,"days"],[25.82,25.9,"Good"],[25.94,26.04,"days,"],[26.34,26.54,"miss"],[26.6,26.64,"the"],[26.74,26.94,"good"],[27.12,27.28,"days"],[27.36,27.4,"Uh,"],[27.44